WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:02.321
(logo whooshing)

00:00:02.321 --> 00:00:04.266
(gentle music)

00:00:04.266 --> 00:00:06.849
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.530
- America, (laughs) what a place.

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.708
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.943
- My father gave his life making this country what it is.

00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:26.994
(upbeat music)

00:00:33.722 --> 00:00:35.110
(tinkly piano music)

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:35.943
(girl lightly snoring)

00:00:35.943 --> 00:00:38.775
(alarm clock ringing)

00:00:38.775 --> 00:00:41.358
(upbeat music)

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.803
- I'd like to talk about this $7 blender,

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.120
I'll give you four.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.810
- This I my money that I earned.

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:00.813
It's not Marvin's money, it's my money.

00:01:01.397 --> 00:01:03.980
(upbeat music)

00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:14.215
(baby groaning)

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:16.610
- It's a sweater!

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.123
(upbeat music)

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:25.403
- What is it?

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.116
- It's a bundt.

00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:28.893
- Bunk, bunk.

00:01:28.893 --> 00:01:29.726
- Bundt.

00:01:29.726 --> 00:01:30.700
- It's a cake!

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.670
- Play nice with the other kids unless of course,

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:33.820
one of the other kids want to fight,

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.450
then you have to kick the other kid's butt.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.740
- But I don't want to kick the other kid's butt.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.323
(upbeat music)

00:01:55.207 --> 00:01:57.423
- [All] Immigrants, we get the job done.

00:01:58.615 --> 00:02:01.198
(upbeat music)

00:02:09.142 --> 00:02:10.330
(logo whooshing)

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.204
(logo squeaking)

